Our incident response plan includes a Security Incident Response Team (SIRT) and playbooks for responding to security incidents, ensuring that we can quickly respond to any potential data breaches or security incidents. Our average time to conduct a Data Protection Impact Assessment (DPIA) is 3 weeks, which can help identify and mitigate potential risks associated with our AI solution.

By implementing these measures, we can ensure that our solution meets the client's regulatory requirements for GDPR compliance, data sovereignty, and explicability of AI recommendations while protecting sensitive data.
