2026-05-26 11:13:14,419 | AGENT | AIInnovation Agent answered: To address the City of Belval's requirements, we can leverage our expertise in AI research and development, particularly in natural language processing and information retrieval. Our proposed solution will focus on designing an intelligent assistance tool that integrates with existing systems of information and business software to provide contextualized answers, facilitate continuity of file processing, and ensure data protection.

